<DescriptionTexts>


\0\0


Manage access to Xbox LIVE from this console.

You need a high-speed connection and a valid Xbox LIVE membership to play on Xbox LIVE.\0


Decide whether new Xbox LIVE memberships can be created from this console.\0


Decide whether to show availability of content that exceeds this console's Family Settings.\0


Set your Family Timer to limit play time on this console.\0


Set a pass code to protect your Family Settings. Your pass code is also used to override game and movie ratings.

You'll need to create a pass code if you use any Family Settings.\0


Reset and disable Family Settings on this console.\0</DescriptionTexts>
